From 93fb032d56de91d2dc9d4f7a82b70e9d205b3ef1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: F4 Animation Plan <dev@f4.local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 02:13:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] f4-anim: semantic animation channels, gear sequencer,
 blink patterns
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

M0 of Docs/AIRCRAFT_ANIMATION_PLAN.md. New leaf library with:
- Channel enum (110 channels) + name<->id mapping: the vocabulary the
  converter binds model nodes to and the rig/renderer communicate in.
  Units mirror what FreeFalcon fed SetDOF/SetSwitch (radians, feet,
  0..1 scales, switch values are BITMASKS per BSwitchNode::Draw).
- AnimValues per-instance state + parked-aircraft preset.
- process_dof_value(): canonical Process_DOFRot port (NEGATE/MINMAX/
  SUBRANGE/ISDOF flags) shared by extractor, glTF evaluator, and rig.
- GearSequencer: FreeFalcon surface.cpp RunGearSurfaces choreography —
  doors first half of gearPos, legs second half, 5 deg visibility
  hysteresis, broken/stuck clamp at 0.6*range — parameterized by
  per-station ranges from auxaero data.
- BlinkWave: nav 0.4/0.5s and strobe 0.08/2.0s patterns with seeded
  deterministic phase (replaces rand()-based de-sync for replay
  determinism; avalanched so adjacent seeds desync properly).
- Spin integrator with 2pi wrap (wheels, rotors).
- vocab/channels.json: advisory human/tooling registry.
32 unit tests porting/locking the FreeFalcon behaviors.
