Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

M2 substrate (AIRCRAFT_ANIMATION_PLAN §5.1): the one-time tag
resolution pass per loaded model.

- F4Extras gains the animation fields the hierarchy emitter writes:
  channel (semantic f4-anim name), op (rot/trans/scale), axis, trans,
  scale_target, reversed (BXSwitch mask inversion). Parsed additively;
  unknown extras fields still skip_value()'d and preserved.
- build_anim_map(): DFS over the default scene collecting every dof
  node and every sw branch node with its node chain (root-first,
  inclusive) and channel binding. Document-order deterministic.
- eval_tagged_local(): composed authored-TRS-with-op evaluation in
  pure double math — rot about a local axis AFTER the frame (FF's
  dof_rotation * Rx(value)), translator vector scaled by the processed
  value, scale lerped to target. Value processing delegates to
  f4-anim::process_dof_value so extractor/gltf/rig share one port of
  Process_DOFRot.
- switch_mask_visible(): the FreeFalcon BSwitchNode::Draw bitmask rule
  (bit k selects child k) with BXSwitchNode reversal.

11 tests pin map structure, channel ordering, Rx-after-frame order,
XDOF processing, trans/scale ops, and the mask visibility rule.
